{"id": "reczz28LdxvOCkfm", "order": 2, "images": ["/media/405d7debde5178e4f633013a.jpg", "/media/5655f87353f93709fd302733.jpg", "/media/c63a4dd56ac137e42623eb3f.jpg", "/media/027845fbfcc04b388037126b.jpg", "/media/7c7753f3721d79559b96ace0.jpg", "/media/fbfbb9a766596143313ee329.jpg", "/media/712abb7aa39449c0a9e43f85.jpg"], "name": "Sparrow Mart", "originalName": "Sparrow Mart", "termName": "Softcore", "author": "Lucy Sparrow", "year": "2018", "medium": "毛毡装置", "collection": "", "caption": "", "why": "整间超市，没有一件商品是硬的。", "whyLong": "这是一家有 31,000 件手工毛毡商品的超市，食品、饮料和包装都被替换成软绵绵的织物。原本充满商业标签的购物空间，突然变得像儿童布偶世界。\n\n它不像多巴胺美学试图让你兴奋，也不像极简主义强调秩序与控制。它试图让你舒服到不需要对周围的一切保持警觉——连购物这件事，都可以不再硬邦邦。", "scene": "", "detail": "", "method": "", "twist": "", "absence": "", "extra": "", "official": "https://www.sewyoursoul.co.uk/exhibition/sparrow-mart/"}